<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n79281" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παρεκ-λέγω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>collect covertly</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. τὰ
				κοινά</span>
			<i>embezzle</i> the public moneys, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				19.294
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				2.575
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.C.
				54.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				76.7
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> of birds,
				<i>collect</i> food <i>here and there</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὅ τι ἂν τύχῃ παρεκλέγων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					8.25
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				17.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>seek to acquire</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς δόξης ἀθάνατον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
					<u>Hist.</u>
					p.251
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i></div>
